      "What makes New York's magic scene relevant to event planners and hosts is the standard it sets. The performers who thrive in New York are those who understand intimacy, timing, and audience connection at the highest level. These are the same skills that define a great private event performer. When you hire a magician for your event, you want someone who can create the feeling of a Steve Cohen show in your living room or a Speakeasy Magick evening at your corporate reception.",
